== History ==
* On 1/6/2026, the Hero Tombstone was added in the game, along with [[Princess/Evolution|Evo Princess]]
* On 6/7/2026, a Balance Update, increased the Tomb Queen's Hitpoints by 20%, decreased the ability cost to 5 elixir (from 6), and her continuous skeleton spawn was removed entirely
* On 4/8/2026, a Balance Update, increased the Tomb Queen's Damage by 32%, increased her sight range to 7 tiles (from 5.5 tiles), and increased her hitpoints by 4%